#: scenario4:scenario4_7E77A93C_97B6_46DB_90A6_D4C6E3A505A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b85bba82adedcbd6b7482e56950288de094ab9d38a2207fa0abf031448a59a85
#. default-sha256: ff4368bd2f397b3c82a347cb657f54a4a1e1282fb614ce873d63898f9ffafd03
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7E77A93C_97B6_46DB_90A6_D4C6E3A505A6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hmm?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Is someone at the door?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mh?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫C’è qualcuno alla porta."

#: scenario4:scenario4_C11C86C8_E501_4EDE_B209_83D989A12E52
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a559dfcbbdd67d4a89839dd39b0eb82d4d8bfd3ece279b2e73db8ddd68a8f3d3
#. default-sha256: 947fdc776c34d0a2a175ca65f78f2b0634981be37534e2ea95994325e746dd77
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C11C86C8_E501_4EDE_B209_83D989A12E52"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The flow of time was hazy within the mansion’s walls. ⟪k:1⟫They had little way of telling "
"whether it was night or day, preventing them from knowing exactly how much time had passed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il flusso del tempo era confuso all’interno delle mura della villa.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non avevano "
"modo di sapere se fosse giorno o notte, e ciò impediva loro di sapere con esattezza quanto tempo "
"fosse trascorso."

#: scenario4:scenario4_39EB3EAB_7C0F_4D68_B10C_55ED104EAC75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87f416ab3001446cb90775da6b9c3ed636587e0fb151c924c8703c2eb6d8803b
#. default-sha256: 73c2b5676763c06e4e111e18f845b0d9100057d305a046584d4587508fc3b815
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_39EB3EAB_7C0F_4D68_B10C_55ED104EAC75"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl had made a habit of climbing the observation tower every so often to "
"see whether the sun was up, which allowed her to approximate the time of day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi aveva preso l’abitudine di salire sulla torre d’osservazione "
"di tanto in tanto, per vedere se il sole era alto,⟪k:1⟫così da poter dedurre—⟪k:2⟫seppur "
"approssimativamente—⟪k:3⟫l’ora del giorno."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F87761B9_B58B_4448_8629_4751E9B8488E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 204fe4dd2d837bf6da6fb1432e2f809830925acd7bc7c1c01c2a7da7621bab68
#. default-sha256: e0bb512d17d703177552a1c03dbe08aa3d65b8a8a3581db5636c09129443e22f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F87761B9_B58B_4448_8629_4751E9B8488E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Consequently, when she heard the knock on the door, she was not aware just how deep the "
"night was outside—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫that forest and beast alike lay quietly at rest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Di conseguenza, quando sentì bussare alla porta, non si rese conto di quanto fosse profonda "
"la notte all’esterno—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫non sapeva che la foresta e le sue creature stavano riposando "
"tranquille."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6C9B35A5_F117_40B3_A387_462780EB00E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45e4cec13581d40f1fce04c3e23d40d528e820191f25cbea0cd16ea89c891252
#. default-sha256: 8b89749ad371f7078fcc6f54aa72e470716d20b1e697288f1882bbebb37b19a4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6C9B35A5_F117_40B3_A387_462780EB00E3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Oh, right, the stores in the cellar ⟪k:1⟫are⟪k:2⟫ almost exhausted...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Ah già, le scorte in cantina sono quasi esaurite...)"

#: scenario4:scenario4_F662AC6A_109C_4237_B301_A595D078DCE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e69bcc7b4ac4cd7c82ef8a02a17b377b4bce60db940f4bfb2e4d2182bb29822
#. default-sha256: 33fe60521787506ff3ce3a6d4eb95e1cfcb3e6886e41252ececa5211497a4925
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F662AC6A_109C_4237_B301_A595D078DCE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(It must be this month’s delivery.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Dev’essere la consegna di questo mese.)"

#: scenario4:scenario4_2FDFD391_D01D_430A_8FB5_8AD19682A08A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 448d3995d76caf141740b5ae4b04e0919654f739a97d6d51652683b716a2e17e
#. default-sha256: 8848f85e07690bfc31fbe23a0fe5e028f34ad87a58230f0c2da3395452cf3103
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2FDFD391_D01D_430A_8FB5_8AD19682A08A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not thinking it was worth bothering Michel over, she made her way out of her chambers and "
"headed for the entrance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pensando che non fosse necessario disturbare Michel, uscì dalla sua stanza dirigendosi verso "
"l’entrata."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A66F8C4E_786F_457E_8E11_6433A05D1710
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4d7796642e9105de1680315aeb9a9cb783e05601b0e2958de029295bd2f20a1
#. default-sha256: 597a4ea19b62b16c8bccd12ac0e3dbbb8bf3dc5558bea1d4121ebc6f3222a0ae
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A66F8C4E_786F_457E_8E11_6433A05D1710"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There had only been a single knock,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫C’era stato un singolo colpo alla porta,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_BBB7D78A_4C7B_4265_83A7_52CF48469070
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6928096117091c64dc48b009f28c1a25614050ce72c919bba38d8c0a16e59dc6
#. default-sha256: 9c196ed7132a15f924766fb6da7c14476abb31cf4fa6c508e2e8e7e8499e12ca
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BBB7D78A_4C7B_4265_83A7_52CF48469070"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫leading her to conclude that, as before, the servant had simply left the box outside the "
"door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫e ciò la portò a supporre che, come l’altra volta, il servo avesse semplicemente lasciato la "
"cassa di fronte all’ingresso."

#: scenario4:scenario4_B01D0B15_E1EE_49B9_BD57_10B0CA1C1B60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a73c7eceaade1bf756575e0e4be8325af7d312ef62aca24a3c059cb7850d416f
#. default-sha256: 3a673fe834d05d566ac798035b8dbdecde64304c251792f6a3e69e6dc13ff60f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B01D0B15_E1EE_49B9_BD57_10B0CA1C1B60"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So without a second thought, she opened the door—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E così, senza pensarci due volte, aprì la porta—"

#: scenario4:scenario4_FC468F18_DCC6_46B6_AD08_05BC3BCEDF6C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd15f5c94e1f82a7e6d5bcbc6a1a884fd803c9eecc1cd4946a961ab5d3ec1995
#. default-sha256: 5933cabec8485a76ee107d2893e2869e7f7f465553337c1fe532802b6d6da036
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FC468F18_DCC6_46B6_AD08_05BC3BCEDF6C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and there she saw a strange, vagrant man standing in the moonlight. ⟪k:1⟫His clothes were "
"tattered, his bearded face bony and emaciated."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫e vide uno strano vagabondo illuminato dalla luna.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I suoi vestiti erano laceri, e "
"il suo viso barbuto era ossuto ed emaciato."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8A71D3D9_E307_411B_ABF6_BB00BFBB53DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fcf4381b14bf43fcadf7f2554144f661ea4283b12537cae7f36986d916302db2
#. default-sha256: f0f04c711f011a8a9874adb15a2c6bd6b568ea1a0eb6f41a83310b961977028e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8A71D3D9_E307_411B_ABF6_BB00BFBB53DD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫—!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_3595D187_60FD_4829_86D6_7B456706EDD3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e16a92ed4dc7badcda2823f3a4960de339ac9cc279df4bef2dc9b26c5cfe337
#. default-sha256: ea3bfe13069b1dc597f76fa28e103f4ef23fbcd439d7f9de7b99a88bcb3d0a64
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3595D187_60FD_4829_86D6_7B456706EDD3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She gasped, shrinking back several paces. ⟪k:1⟫The heavy door began to swing shut, but the "
"man forced it open,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Lei sussultò, indietreggiando di alcuni passi."

#: scenario4:scenario4_DCDC200C_5930_4228_A84C_5A1555F94B21
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1c8df9bdb03b031ce955a6edf87ab5af01dce5aff32f7136e0482a2610f8634
#. default-sha256: 31fe9861eca44391b879c10a9f3688998ee85cb015aa7f4471443e1f85fcac35
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DCDC200C_5930_4228_A84C_5A1555F94B21"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫glaring down at her with unfocused eyes and mumbling,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il pesante portone stava per richiudersi, ma l’uomo lo riaprì con la forza, guardando la "
"ragazza con occhi assenti, e mormorando:"

#: scenario4:scenario4_0E7B69CA_31B2_4FCD_9779_175E3F94FB67
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33dbbbfac303a0a3a24fb815a379589356804f35d408afbe8012f66b352c2b15
#. default-sha256: 1a736f828c7ff16afc9c6ba6b2f07f84ea8eccbd269dba15461258951274ea8e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0E7B69CA_31B2_4FCD_9779_175E3F94FB67"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Are ye the witch that’ll grant people’s wishes?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sei tu la strega che esaudisce i desideri della gente?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_A34CF1FA_E92C_44D3_B497_C6503B98EBB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63fc2dc8b33b132c46abdf6fea6c0bceb0138eedc057a70dde1ea52f701c3a98
#. default-sha256: 91bb1c7bb4505fe9603ec8b837747135dc5b148c64746de65600631e620747b5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A34CF1FA_E92C_44D3_B497_C6503B98EBB9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was in that moment that the White-Haired Girl realized she had been careless. ⟪k:1⟫The "
"man had sought out the mansion because he believed the legend of the witch."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Fu in quell’istante che la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi si rese conto di essere stata "
"sconsiderata. ⟪k:1⟫L’uomo era andato in cerca della villa perché credeva alla leggenda della "
"strega."

#: scenario4:scenario4_3EA1F26B_E711_4316_A68E_172EC1760EB6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ffc9b865d7c5de20cf344d6fa2d166dd0ea07ff0b5d4343df38856ad37b544ea
#. default-sha256: d9bbb273256f46d44d8d2d1df02a1776070275fd815a05b40c2de64fef1e6d98
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3EA1F26B_E711_4316_A68E_172EC1760EB6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And he did not seem particularly right of mind, either—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫perhaps a result of "
"wandering through the forest for several days. Or perhaps it was ⟪k:3⟫because⟪k:4⟫ he was so "
"beaten down that he thought to ask for a witch’s help."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E non sembrava nemmeno avere la testa a posto—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫forse perché aveva vagato attraverso "
"la foresta per diversi giorni. O forse era proprio perché si trovava in quello stato che aveva "
"deciso di chiedere l’aiuto di una strega."

#: scenario4:scenario4_C7257A84_1D3E_4823_A936_F17F36BE0932
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 870d25152c6387308527599ec9d6050f2874c1f8c2befc07121d3b6bdd05b86b
#. default-sha256: 5e9d4d8d17b1796ab125cbc4039bc93eafd71b6fee9386092901c2bc6193162d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C7257A84_1D3E_4823_A936_F17F36BE0932"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In a word, he seemed mad."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫In poche parole, sembrava pazzo."

#: scenario4:scenario4_88F28DEE_9E99_46D5_872F_3095AA05A27B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 267106e931030d029f82668f1c50e31907522b4a5e5804b6efbd2704c293eaa4
#. default-sha256: 65cc0ce65b217f082185908cbedd236ebb7aa115c0ad3b78d5ac7c991666353b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_88F28DEE_9E99_46D5_872F_3095AA05A27B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫N-⟪k:1⟫No...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫There is no witch here..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫N-⟪k:1⟫No...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non c’è alcuna strega qui..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1BE00853_0238_48B0_BA1C_28E0370C7C4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 650ba306c53b6f3872432447a58134fc34d8c3c6d07be03a8d5261791f533415
#. default-sha256: e85cf384eadc07c6e9e6ca672d8331ba5d30fa097ff382288fe1b9dfed8e11bd
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1BE00853_0238_48B0_BA1C_28E0370C7C4D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Sure there is. Don’t ye lie to me...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I can ’ear the witch’s voice..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sì, invece. Non mentirmi...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Riesco a sentire la sua voce..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_880EC7AC_1F2B_4DD7_B643_47239262DAF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d319dcc9f215011f2d0369fcb92e2f95805208154e8820ab733f2443decd12c7
#. default-sha256: 0a5d951426790f1a833bed35cbba4267117d0a3ee6be979b4834c4e41c661570
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_880EC7AC_1F2B_4DD7_B643_47239262DAF2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She led me to this ’ouse!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ lei che mi ha guidato fino a questa casa!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_75400493_59A8_4243_BB66_2EE779585351
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bab41bffdc7716c0420b291c107090b0629f6ba157bf08cf95e2722159d250de
#. default-sha256: 4436ed78784d23d2f2631e230cbe65089c8501e26c6b9c6220f84ef9d06e7105
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_75400493_59A8_4243_BB66_2EE779585351"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ngh... ⟪k:1⟫I-⟪k:2⟫I promise you, there isn’t!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Now please, be on your way!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ngh... ⟪k:1⟫L-⟪k:2⟫Lo giuro, non è qui!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ora la prego, se ne vada!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_0237B531_A3CD_4C65_886E_E37919AB5260
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b68ca52cfdc83124e9857f5afdb8ac6776e325212fe1390086500a218bb1fc0
#. default-sha256: 8f3165ce43a779e236815ac7d099cc6f274f2b71356c6c942bbf593cc18a68bf
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0237B531_A3CD_4C65_886E_E37919AB5260"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫’Ave ye any idea ’ow long it took to find this place?!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫’Ow many days I’ve gone "
"without food or water?!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And ye’re tellin’ me to get lost?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hai la minima idea di quanto tempo mi ci è voluto per trovare⟪k:1⟫questo posto?!⟪k:2⟫ Di "
"quanti giorni ho passato senza cibo né acqua?!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫E tu mi dici di andarmene?!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_099B4492_1369_4746_AD8C_8DC846C0252B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77c50de7914196769972026cdbb518d2df387c1c9b5b5e3171e534b54619214e
#. default-sha256: 309b5dfa9cdfb0cf628d7aca76fd8592003eadb719d8d4d75949e9986cb96d25
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_099B4492_1369_4746_AD8C_8DC846C0252B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I-⟪k:1⟫I don’t know what you want from me...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’m happy to give you a little food, "
"so please!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫N-⟪k:1⟫Non so cosa lei voglia da me...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Sarò felice di darle un po’ di cibo, per cui "
"la prego!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_1A36B37C_383A_4DC1_8071_2124A926CB5C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5c548c7e518a75ad06baa947a3cf54f15a2037494914428f0a094922c4efd99
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1A36B37C_383A_4DC1_8071_2124A926CB5C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario4:scenario4_243F0BF8_9390_4410_8605_330C9EF078E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a63b0ba969302cd0750294eb87d863751e9e329658835178cefbaf5be12ca45a
#. default-sha256: 871d6e88953ca6fe57d1082bf0f3de11fbae9494948d58acdb85b8901516eda4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_243F0BF8_9390_4410_8605_330C9EF078E7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Is there really no witch?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Davvero non c’è alcuna strega?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_1C6FABC2_2B88_4E56_9069_06BE40D16A79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3285cdf079b9d23aa150dbe14e70415acda2470765303c0cfacd623c67f0c61d
#. default-sha256: b732ff51825e1ba1bc52bde12027ff9b422681f0aa354f67850a852ac219431e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1C6FABC2_2B88_4E56_9069_06BE40D16A79"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There’s no witch here!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s nothing but a legend.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫If she does exist, she "
"doesn’t live here."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non c’è nessuna strega qui!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫È⟪k:4⟫ solo una leggenda.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫E se anche "
